WEBVTT

00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:31.420
when our technologies
are supposed to improve our lives?

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:35.299
And why do we feel so disconnected,

00:01:35.341 --> 00:01:40.304
when our inventions are meant to connect
each and every one of us?

00:01:42.265 --> 00:01:47.520
My artwork deals with evolution,
biology and the senses.

00:01:48.729 --> 00:01:53.317
I'm interested in how organisms
are composed of different life-forms,

00:01:53.317 --> 00:01:57.113
such as bacteria, fungi and viruses ...

00:01:58.197 --> 00:02:03.077
but also how different chemical
and molecular interactions can happen